        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(loki_discarded_samples_total{job=\"observability/loki\"}[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "rate_limited / per_stream_rate_limit are the limits_config caps (LokiDiscardsRateLimited); too_far_behind / greater_than_max_sample_age are the accept window (LokiDiscardsOutOfOrder). Every discarded line is lost - RF=1 and senders do not retry a 4xx."
